      "Keep the requested configuration for this trial. It reduced historical candle requests from 47 to 12 per revisit sweep versus baseline, with pooled p95 349.4ms to 314.5ms.",
      "Reducing the budget to 128MiB changed post-GC JS heap from ~696MiB to ~677MiB while increasing history requests to 77. In this short-revisit workload, raw range caches retain shared data outside the canonical budget.",
      "A 64-entry indicator cap had fewer candle requests but relies on raw indicator restoration before its 30min GC. These results do not establish the best limit for later revisits.",
